OL,3,GNEWSAMet Police ruined my life, says
OL,4,AKenyan man wrongly convicted over
OL,5,Aattack on UK couple
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Kenyan woodcutter who was wrongly
OL,8,Fconvicted and sentenced to death over
OL,9,Fan attack on a British couple has told
OL,10,Fthe BBC that actions by London's
OL,11,FMetropolitan Police involved in the
OL,12,Fcase destroyed his life.
OL,14,FSomali gunmen broke into David and
OL,15,FJudith Tebbutt's beach bungalow on the
OL,16,FKenyan coast in 2011. They shot David
OL,17,Fdead and abducted Judith, holding her
OL,18,Fcaptive in Somalia for six months.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
