OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMet Police ruined my life, says
OL,4,AKenyan man wrongly convicted over
OL,5,Aattack on UK couple
OL,6,
OL,7,FMet detectives flew to Kenya to assist
OL,8,Fthe investigation. Their evidence
OL,9,Fhelped convict Ali Kololo, who spent
OL,10,Fmore than a decade in prison before his
OL,11,Fconviction was overturned.
OL,13,FKololo is suing the Met, claiming a
OL,14,Fsenior officer, former Detective
OL,15,FSuperintendent Neil Hibberd, gave
OL,16,Fmisleading evidence at his trial and
OL,17,Facted unlawfully to secure his
OL,18,Fconviction.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
